g item configuration","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/hr-catalog-item-configuration.md","line":31},{"title":"create an HR catalog item","target":"create-hr-catalog-item","line":32},{"title":"Configure a record producer for an HR service","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/configure-hr-record-producer.md","line":32},{"title":"Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","target":"agent-ws-hr-case-mgmt-landing-page","line":33},{"title":"HR Service Delivery","target":"hr-service-delivery","line":33},{"title":"HR service catalog management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/hr-service-catalog-management.md","line":35},{"title":"HR Administration","target":"c_AdministerHRServiceManagement","line":47},{"title":"HR services","target":"hr-service-administration","line":128},{"title":"Create an HR catalog item","target":"create-hr-catalog-item","line":129},{"title":"Agent Workspace for HR Case Management","target":"agent-ws-hr-case-mgmt-landing-page","line":130},{"title":"HR Service Delivery","target":"hr-service-delivery","line":131},{"title":"HR Administration","target":"c_AdministerHRServiceManagement","line":132}],"metadata":{"title":"HR service catalog categorization","description":"HR catalog items in the HR service catalog are organized into categories. The categories define the organizational structure for the catalog so that employees can more easily browse and request the HR services they need.Create a new category in the HR service catalog.Edit an existing category in the HR service catalog.Assign or remove one or more HR catalog items from a category in the HR service catalog.Assign or remove categories for an HR catalog item in the HR service catalog.","locale":"